  "updated_at": "2026-01-12T01:55:42.037676+00:00",
  "source": "https://doi.org/10.1093/qje/qju022",
  "reference": "Chetty R, Hendren N, Kline P, Saez E. Where is the Land of Opportunity? The Geography of Intergenerational Mobility in the United States. Quarterly Journal of Economics. 2014;129(4):1553-1623."
